{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/06/15/0586962/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日お仕事おわり、みさ先輩と、せいたんと、(川後の)ひなちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆのお家にきて、みんなでゲームしたよ！┗(^o^ )┓<33"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっっっっべぇー楽しかった！！！めっちゃ楽しかった！ふぎゃふぎゃふぎゃふぎゃ( `^ω^)=3"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いすぎてお腹壊れるかと思ったわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてこったピコピコのゲーム！⊂( ^-^)⊃おまえ！中々やりおるな！⊂( ^-^)⊃初めてテレビでピコピコやったから、ゲームってこんなに楽しいのか！⊂( ^-^)⊃って知ってしまった！⊂( ^-^)⊃やべーやべー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"人生初ピコピコ！ピコピコピコピコピーコ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにより、ゲームをクリアすることにより、４人の間に変な絆が生まれた（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真剣にピコピコしてるみさ先輩( ^o^ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/06/15/0001.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それで！今日は、ひなちゃんと深川巡りに行ってきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"深川江戸資料館とかに行ったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に行こうねってお約束してた「清澄庭園」にも、行けて嬉しかった☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アジサイがきれいだったよ＼( ^o^ )／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/sayuri.inoue/img/2013/06/15/0586962/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"季節を感じる！ほっこり＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夕方からは、とまととせいたんと"},{"type":"break"